# 标准库 collections_core：join / split（Python str.split(sep) 口径）
# 注：字符串「入列表」输出存在 native/黄金 format_plain 引号契约分歧（同 35 例注释），
# split 的列表形态一律经 join 归一为标量字符串或 len 归一为数字后再打印；
# 完整列表形状由 tests/test_matha_library_basics.py 对拍 Python 真相锁定。
[join("-", [1, 2, 3])]
[join("", [1, 2])]
[join(",", [])]
[join("+", ["x", "y"])]
[join("-", [10, true, 2.5])]
# split 往返：split 后用 join 重建语义
[join(",", split("a,b,c", ","))]
[len(split("a,,b", ","))]
[join(":", split("a::b::c", "::"))]
[join(",", split("abc", ","))]
[len(split("", ","))]
[join("-", split("a,b,", ","))]
[len(split(",,", ","))]
